4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JZNA0Kw4eOoQ7kNvwHDPofM&_nc_oc=AdoZRBHX3Liw6vKA3Dq0QiIGgb1qlmasgI2x60ZtH2s99Df2JuXaKix9BYE2oFHm31s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0AFQogv1lFmiW9Qa9tgWc2-M6YIbBreuVU2rCs-S-KHw&oe=69E4D2D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yrDmqeabjp8Q7kNvwHoWzK5&_nc_oc=AdrVcEUP0owV_keVsL2nknJbDlGSW-IhVOBg8wfvvwlnzro9-Wo3SJ_5tt3CI6RpR9E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0XANFOWPo9zSsBULH_uhyQQnIL2oOzLHCw36qa8a7w2g&oe=69E4D7B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6kj8Fk3jeKkQ7kNvwEiNGZh&_nc_oc=AdrmWSVZLIFebBvGCMpMWBQZEyDSl17D2v9uuzK6p3yJ-DpqjHnLKLGX9s8BFBLZOJ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1dzO2UN69FDiiPBMvYFoHWf94gHmToP-T3si8y7cFhUA&oe=69E4E555"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p